# Boost on 52's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# The chain's lone fighter is Torterra (Staraptor carries the HMs, Riolu is level 1). After the gym's seven trainers
# its PP was spent and Volkner (trdata.json #320: RAICHU 46, AMBIPOM 47, OCTILLERY 47, LUXRAY 49) won in 10 turns.
# Level 85 and its moves set again (PP full): Earthquake (2x on Raichu/Luxray), Stone Edge, Seed Bomb (2x on
# Octillery); slot 2 keeps Rock Climb (Victory Road, 55).
party-level 0 85
party-move 0 0 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
party-move 0 1 MOVE_STONE_EDGE
party-move 0 3 MOVE_SEED_BOMB
